registry.description:
Export the current checkpoint with its SHA-256, complete specification report and all-frame seating check.
Seating is measured for every frame and reported even when it fails. Weigh it against the photos;
specification and print validity remain required for finish.

Read any saved full tool report without repeating its operation. Long outputs are summaries;
all original values remain here. Select a JSON pointer, page a table or filter rows. Text mode pages the exact
JSON serialization (or original string), including a single oversized item. No scene changes or model calls.
